<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σκάπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dig up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.3.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλην πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.924c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>extirpate,</i> of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.5
			</span></i> (prob. l.); <i>raze to the ground,</i> of buildings, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).526a4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Eresus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of ulcers with 'undermined edges', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβρωμένα καὶ ἀνεσκαμμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.106(96)
			</span></i>.</div>
